<div class="about-body">
  <h1 class="about-head">about</h1>
  <p>
    october tooth is zachary carter threlkeld. this space is where cassette tapes,
    arrangement ideas, and song starts go when they're recorded on my 
    tascam 424 mkiii — usually with somethin' muted on my old batman tv in the background.
  </p>
  <p>
    there's no fixed schedule. roughly a tape every few weeks, sometimes
    faster, sometimes not. a few of these might eventually get mastered into
    proper releases — most won't. this is the squeeze part,
    not the juice part.
  </p>
  <p>
    alongside the tapes: paintings, photos, playlists, and whatever else
    seems fun to share. shows and releases get announced here
    too. bunch o' good stuff.
  </p>
</div>

